---
const COMPANY_NAME = "PROWRAP Interior Film";
const CEO = "우선찬";
const PHONE = "010-5074-1018";
const ADDRESS = "경기도 고양시 덕양구 의장로 146 1903호";
---

<footer class="bg-[#0a0a0a] text-[#808080] py-12 md:py-16 border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start gap-10 md:gap-20">
      
      <div class="space-y-6 max-w-sm">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white text-[15px] font-black tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-2">{COMPANY_NAME}</h2>
          <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-[#555555] font-medium uppercase">Real Film · Real Finish</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#666666]">
          프로랩은 디테일의 차이가 완성도를 만든다는 신념으로<br class="hidden sm:block" />
          모든 현장에서 정직하고 정교한 시공을 약속드립니다.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[11px] tracking-wider text-[#444444]">
          &copy; 2026 PROWRAP. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-10 md:gap-16 w-full md:w-auto">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-[11px] font-bold text-white/40 tracking-widest uppercase">Contact & Info</h3>
          <div class="space-y-2 text-[13px]">
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="w-12 text-[#555555]">대표자</span>
              <span class="text-[#999999]">{CEO}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="w-12 text-[#555555]">연락처</span>
              <a href="tel:01050741018" class="text-[#999999] hover:text-white transition-colors">{PHONE}</a>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="w-12 text-[#555555]">주소</span>
              <span class="text-[#999999] leading-relaxed">{ADDRESS}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-start sm:items-end gap-6">
          <button type="button" id="authmark-trigger" class="opacity-40 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity cursor-pointer" aria-label="IBK 기업은행 안심이체 인증마크">
            <img 
              src="https://kiup.ibk.co.kr/IBK/uib/ecb/img/KO/esc/sub/imgIbkMark.gif" 
              alt="인증마크" 
              width="40"
              height="40"
              class="grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all"
            />
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <form name="AUTHMARK_FORM" method="POST" class="hidden">
      <input type="hidden" name="authmarkinfo" value="5786121914deee67e7275959dd75cf72">
    </form>
  </div>
</footer>

<script is:inline>
  function onPopAuthMark(key) {
    const popup = window.open('', 'AUTHMARK_POPUP', 'height=900, width=630, status=yes, toolbar=no, menubar=no, location=no');
    if (popup) {
      document.AUTHMARK_FORM.authmarkinfo.value = key;
      document.AUTHMARK_FORM.action = 'https://kiup.ibk.co.kr/uib/jsp/guest/esc/esc25/getAuthMark.jsp';
      document.AUTHMARK_FORM.target = 'AUTHMARK_POPUP';
      document.AUTHMARK_FORM.submit();
    }
  }

  document.getElementById('authmark-trigger')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    onPopAuthMark('5786121914deee67e7275959dd75cf72');
  });
</script>
